    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d74">

                <pb facs="0201" n="107" sameAs="frus:frus1930v03/pg107"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">462.00R294/788b</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        Germany</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Sackett</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-07-01">July 1, 1930</date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 124</seg></opener>
                <p>The Secretary of State transmits herewith, for the information of the Embassy, a
                    press statement issued on June 23, 1930, as well <pb facs="0202" n="108"
                        xml:id="pg108"/> as the Agreement between the Governments of the German
                    Reich and the United States of America, relative to the complete and final
                    discbarge of the obligations of Germany to the United States in respect of the
                    awards of the Mixed Claims Commission, United States and Germany, and the costs
                    of the United States Army of Occupation.<anchor n="31" xml:id="d74-f1"/></p>


                <xi:include href="d74-a1.xml" xpointer="d74-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d74-f1" n="31" xml:id="d74-f1-content">
                <p>For text of the agreement, see <hi rendition="#italic">Annual Report of the
                        Secretary of the Treasury … 1930</hi>, p. 341; or League of Nations Treaty
                    Series, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">cvi</hi>, p. 121.</p>
            </note>
